<title>NETHERLANDS: KNP BT nine months profit down 65 pct.</title>
<headline>KNP BT nine months profit down 65 pct.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1996-10-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>First nine months 1996 paper maker NV Koninklijke KNP BT</p>
<p>(millions of guilders unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit from ordinary ops	 139     vs  394</p>
<p>    Net per ord share (guilders)	   1.10  vs    3.64</p>
<p>    Turnover (billions)		     9.98   vs   11.13</p>
<p>    Operating profit			 358     vs  670</p>
<p>    Financial charges			116     vs  175</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
